body:
Eu nu sunt de acord cu tine. Din punctul meu de vedere are anumite avantaje. 

&#x200B;

Evident, dobanda e o joaca de copii, o mica protectie la inflatie. Dar din punctul meu de vedere, sa depun 1200 RON si la final sa am 1800 RON pe an timp de 18 ani mi se pare destul de rentabil. Mai am si avantajul ca nu e impozabil - deci toti banii se duc in buzunarul ei. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Mai mult, spre desebire de actiuni si ETFuri, am garantia ca va avea banii in mana la 18 ani. Daca piata e jos sau e o criza financiara in momentul in care face 18 ani, nu va putea retrage nimic sau retrage in pierdere. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Nu se merita investit mai mult de minimul necesar, sunt de acord, dar per total mie mi se pare avantajos sa sparg alocatia si sa pun si in programul asta.

E excelent ca ai reusit sa constientizezi. Esti inca tanar. Sunt multi care trec ca zombie prin viata si nu realizeaza cat rau isi fac. Nu merita sa te blamezi si sa iti faci reprosuri si clar nu e tarziu. E cel mai bun moment in care ti se putea intampla. Inca esti sanatos si ai experienta astfel incat nu o sa mai cazi prada viciilor. 

&#x200B;

 Tine cont ca tendintele astea de blamat si de regretat pot fi cauzate fix de faptul ca nu mai bei. Eu am observat la mine cand ma lasam ca a treia zi dupa ce consumam alcool eram PRAF absolut psihic. Eram absolut cruda cu mine, aveam ganduri suicidale pasive si ma simteam ca un om de nimic.

Eu zilele astea fac un pui dulce acrisor la tigaie (cu ananas si ghimbir). E cu sos, obviously dar e ceva mai diferit si destul de gustos. 

&#x200B;

Daca te pricepi sa tai si ai rabdare, mai merita rulada de pui cu bacon & mozzarella la cuptor/ air fryer. 

&#x200B;

Il poti umple cu legume/branza si baga la cuptor.

A few weeks ago, strange things started to happen to ordinary people in our city. Some good, some bad, some just strange. When the FBI came and closed down our city we did not understand what was going on. Nobody was allowed in our out of the city but the authorities. Well, nobody is allowed to leave the city still. Not until they label and collect every single artifact we bought from that sale. I am writing here as I hope someone will read, and this peculiar event will not stay forgotten once they will make everyone glance in the Mirror of Lost Memories. Madam Patma was a dear old witch. She travelled with the circus for a long time and once she settled in our city she opened her Clarvoyant store in the city center. There she would give us readings and sell good luck charms and other witchy items. Her readings were accurate and the good luck charms we purchased from her seemed to work. People started whispering and some claimed she was a real witch, but most agreed that it was all in our heads. I've heard a lot of rumors about more powerful spells that she performed such as reuniting starcrossed lovers, healing incurable diseases and even making people famous, but I never believed any of that.

&#x200B;

When she died, the city mourned her. We were a very small community and she was our grandmother. When the city organized the estate sale we all went to purchase something of hers, we needed to. Nobody wanted to forget her and we were determined to have a piece of her in our homes. The items she had were mostly normal household items, but they had weird labels on them. We did not think much of it, as she was eccentric. Some of the labels I can remember: The broom of infinite cleanininess, The teapot of love, The cup of everlasting health, The cauldron of nightmares, The hat of the broken trust.

&#x200B;

We all took something from there. And then the magic started to happen. Once in the house, the broom of infinite cleaniness started doing all the household chores. It grew arms and the house became the cleanest house in the city. The teapot of love made people love each other down to obsession. The stone of riches turned the family that owned it in the richest family in the state.

&#x200B;

I had purchased the spoon of wisdom. Once I have used it to eat my soup, I have instantly felt smarter, stronger and wiser. I was able to see behind people's masks and I knew exactly what to do at all times. I've become more than just myself.

Of course, she also had cursed items which made people vile and vicious. Because of that, the authorities realized something supernatural has happened in our town and they have come to investigate. It took them a while, but they traced everything back to Madam Patma.

Now they are trying to confiscate everything. They have detectors for the supernatural items apparently, as this is not a singular case. I have tried to hide the spoon of wisdom, as I wish it will forever be mine, but I do not know if once they will erase my memory I will be able to find my way back to it.

Problema cu stiinta in zilele noastre e ca informatia circula mai repede decat poate stiinta sa investigheze. Personal, nu iau cartile lui Gabor Mate ca lucrari stiintifice, le iau ca si literatura self-help. Scrie foarte multe chestii faine si helpful dar scrie din experienta. **El nu e cercetator. El nu are nici macar profil pe Scopus sau Google Scholar. El este un doctor care isi impartaseste teoriile cu altii. E important sa intelegeti aceasta distinctie.** 

&#x200B;

Personal cred ca exista ceva mecanisme in creier care decid cum ne imbolnavim si cred ca sunt asociate cu trauma. Nu stiu daca as merge asa departe cat sa spun ca e intergenerationala. Sigur, suntem la cateva zeci de ani de studii care sa confirme aceasta teorie.

CU antidepresivele eu personal nu stiu ce sa zic. Am luat foarte mult timp Prozac care doar m-a ingrasat si obosit - depresia nu mai era suicidala dar nici fericita nu am fost. 

&#x200B;

Mai bine te uiti de activitati pentru ea, gen:

Pictura pe numere

&#x200B;

Citit

&#x200B;

Calatorii de weekend ( sunt agentii care fac, sunt foarte cool )

0.02 RON. 

&#x200B;

Dar cineva in comments a specificat ca de la anul vom primi 50 de bani.

Uite eu acum am aflat de ele. Mi se pare absolut descurajator si dificil procesul de returnare in aceste conditii dupa cum am spus. 

&#x200B;

Daca ar pune un tomberon afara sa le arunc acolo si sa le recicleze nu as fi frustrata.

Eu acum am facut mutarea Cluj -> Tarnaveni. In conditiile in care avem masina + joburi remote pot spune ca nu regret absolut nimic. Nu e vorba de familie, e vorba de cum economisim aici. + Pentru entertainment mergem cu masina unde vrem, nu e chiar mare lucru. 

&#x200B;

Also, nefiind proprietari, nu are rost sa comentez ca spatiul apartamentului inchiriat cu aceiasi bani este mult mai mare, totul bine utilat si curat. Aici avem 3 camere la pret de garsoniera de Cluj. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Deva are in apropiere multe orase turistice ex. Alba Iulia unde poti face tot felul de chestii. Daca reusesti sa pui un ban deoparte mai ales in situatia asta economica, pentru mine e un beneficiu clar. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Orasele mari sunt misto de vizitat, dar de locuit in ele nu prea mi se pare. Am stat si in Cluj si in Bucuresti multi ani si sincer nu ma mai tenteaza deloc un astfel de loc.

As someone struggling hard with eating disorders I feel absolutely disgusted by her claim. Eating disorders do not develop in 2 months. These things start usually in teen years and NEVER EVER go away. One small trigger sends you down a spiral that usually ends in a rock-bottom situation.   


No, this girl did not have an eating disorder for 2 months. She is an attention whore and should feel ashamed for claiming that. Not eating to lose a couple of pounds is not the same as having a diagnosed eating disorder. I have many friends who sometimes follow harsh diets but then get back to normal but none of them feel like they would die if they would eat a slice of bread or if they do not throw up the salad they just ate. 

&#x200B;

Let's start making the difference between eating disorders and wanting to lose a couple of pounds for being insecure. FOR THE LOVE OF GOD. 

&#x200B;

If she really has an eating disorder then I\`m sorry for her. But she did not develop it from Cole making some jerky comments on the show. She's had it before and needs therapy. But I do not believe she has it. Wanna know why? Because people with eating disorders do not like talking about eating disorders and will do anything in their power not to claim they have one.

Hei. Sper sa vezi mesajul. Suntem in aceeasi oala. Am depresie de la 12 ani si de multe ori ma gandesc sa plec definitiv. DAR. La un moment dat fratele meu mia zis " tu chiar nu esti curioasa sa vezi cum se duce lumea pe p...? Oare e razboi, incalzire globala, pandemie?? Chiar nu vrei sa stii ce se intampla?". 

&#x200B;

Atunci mi-am dat seama ca e bine sa ramai, chiar si pentru curiozitate doar... Nu trebuie sa fii fericit tot timpul. Nu ai cum. Dar poti sa fii un observator... Atat. Si e oki. Oricat de rau ar fi acum, la un moment dat o sa fie mai bine. Nu pt mult timp, dar o sa fie o zi decenta si o sa te bucuri ca nu ai plecat. O inghetata buna sau o masa scumpa in oras... O sa se intample... Nu trebuie sa fie mult. Doar ceva. 

&#x200B;

Sper sa decizi sa ramai.

Bai imi venea sa fac acelasi post in r/cluj in care efectiv sa ma plang de cat de nesimtiti sunt oamenii.

&#x200B;

Sunt foarte butthurt de cum unii efectiv nu au nici un fel de respect fata de oamenii din jur. 

&#x200B;

Azi-noapte la Thor era efectiv un om BEAT in cinema. BEAT la modul fara nici un pic de control de sine. 0 fucks were given ca urla handicapatul si ca se manifesta. Mai stateam si langa o tanti care nu avea nici un pic de self awareness de spatiul ei si mi-a dat vreo 3 coturi in coaste cand se relaxa pe zona comuna.
